@startuml Dependency Graph Validation
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Dependency Graph Validation\n(Prevents Deadlocks and Circular Dependencies)

package "Valid Orchestration Patterns" {
  rectangle "Pattern 1: Simple Pair" #LightGreen {
    rectangle "Task A\n(Root)" as A1
    rectangle "Task B\n(depends_on_task_id: A)" as B1
    A1 --> B1 : dependency

    note bottom
      **Valid:**
      - 1 root (A)
      - 1 dependent (B)
      - No cycles
    end note
  }

  rectangle "Pattern 2: One-to-Many" #LightGreen {
    rectangle "Red\n(Root)" as R2
    rectangle "Blue1\n(depends_on_task_id: Red)" as B2
    rectangle "Blue2\n(depends_on_task_id: Red)" as B3
    R2 --> B2
    R2 --> B3

    note bottom
      **Valid:**
      - 1 root (Red)
      - 2 dependents (Blue1, Blue2)
      - Both can run after Red ready
    end note
  }

  rectangle "Pattern 3: Independent Orchestrations" #LightGreen {
    rectangle "Group 1" {
      rectangle "A" as A3
      rectangle "B" as B3
      A3 --> B3
    }

    rectangle "Group 2" {
      rectangle "C" as C3
      rectangle "D" as D3
      C3 --> D3
    }

    note bottom
      **Valid:**
      - 2 separate orchestrations
      - No cross-dependencies
      - Each is independent
    end note
  }
}

package "Invalid Orchestration Patterns" {
  rectangle "Anti-Pattern 1: Circular Dependency" #LightCoral {
    rectangle "Task X" as X1
    rectangle "Task Y" as Y1
    rectangle "Task Z" as Z1
    X1 --> Y1 : depends_on_task_id
    Y1 --> Z1 : depends_on_task_id
    Z1 --> X1 : depends_on_task_id (CYCLE!)

    note bottom
      **Invalid: Circular Dependency**
      Error: "Circular dependency detected in task graph: ..."

      Validation: graphlib.TopologicalSorter.prepare()
      raises CycleError during graph validation
    end note
  }

  rectangle "Anti-Pattern 2: Nested Orchestration" #LightCoral {
    rectangle "Root A" as A2 {
      rectangle "Task 1" as T1
      rectangle "Task 2" as T2
      T1 --> T2
    }
    rectangle "Root B\n(depends_on_task_id: Root A)" as B2 {
      rectangle "Task 3" as T3
      rectangle "Task 4" as T4
      T3 --> T4
    }
    A2 --> B2 : NESTED!

    note bottom
      **Invalid: Nested Orchestration**
      Error: "Nested orchestrations not supported:
             '{root_id}' is a dependency root
             but also depends on '{target_id}'.
             Each orchestration must be independent."

      Reason: Complex semaphore accounting
      A root cannot also be a dependent
    end note
  }

  rectangle "Anti-Pattern 3: Orphan Dependent" #LightCoral {
    rectangle "Task M\n(depends_on_task_id: 'unknown')" as M1

    note bottom
      **Warning: Missing Dependency Target**
      Log: "Orphaned dependent task: {task_id}
            (dependency target not found)"

      Task is skipped during orchestration assembly.
      The warning is logged but no exception is raised.
    end note
  }
}

note as ValidationSteps
  **DependencyGraph Class**
  (src/saber/models/benchmark_task.py)

  **Purpose:** Analyzes task dependency relationships
  and validates orchestration structure

  **Attributes:**
  • dependencies: Dict[str, str]  # dependent -> target
  • dependents: Dict[str, List[str]]  # target -> [dependents]
  • dependency_roots: Set[str]
  • all_tasks: Set[str]

  **Key Methods:**
  • add_task(task_id: str) -> None
  • add_dependency(dependent: str, target: str) -> None
  • is_root(task_id: str) -> bool
  • is_dependent(task_id: str) -> bool
  • get_dependents(task_id: str) -> List[str]
  • get_dependency_target(task_id: str) -> Optional[str]
  • validate_acyclic() -> None
  • validate_no_nested_orchestrations() -> None
  • get_orchestrated_groups() -> List[List[str]]
  • get_independent_tasks() -> List[str]

  **Validation Steps (in BenchmarkManager._build_dependency_graph):**
  1. Add all tasks to graph via add_task()
  2. Add dependencies from task.depends_on_task_id via add_dependency()
  3. validate_acyclic() - Check for cycles using graphlib.TopologicalSorter
  4. validate_no_nested_orchestrations() - Ensure no root is also a dependent
  5. Group tasks by dependency root via get_orchestrated_groups()
  6. Create one OrchestratedTask per group in _assemble_benchmark_tasks()
end note

@enduml
